WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.299
Bat went into the hole.

2
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:17.882
The barn was dry.

3
00:00:17.883 --> 00:00:25.316
But was it safe?

4
00:00:25.317 --> 00:00:28.646
Bat did not know.

5
00:00:28.647 --> 00:00:35.316
He looked around.

6
00:00:35.317 --> 00:00:39.386
The barn was big.

7
00:00:39.387 --> 00:00:41.988
And Bat was little.

8
00:00:41.989 --> 00:00:47.026
So maybe it was safe.

9
00:00:47.027 --> 00:00:55.543
Bat hung by his feet.

10
00:00:55.544 --> 00:01:07.671
He went to sleep.

11
00:01:07.672 --> 00:01:13.995
The next day Bat woke up.

12
00:01:13.996 --> 00:01:18.549
It was still raining.

13
00:01:18.550 --> 00:01:20.771
Bat looked down.

14
00:01:20.772 --> 00:01:27.440
He saw a brown cow.

15
00:01:27.441 --> 00:01:31.537
He saw a yellow cat.

16
00:01:31.538 --> 00:01:39.949
He heard a pig.

17
00:01:39.950 --> 00:01:43.773
But there were no bats.

18
00:01:43.774 --> 00:01:48.100
Did Cow and Cat and Pig like bats?

19
00:01:48.101 --> 00:01:54.022
Could they be his friends?

20
00:01:54.023 --> 00:01:59.269
"I will wait and see," Bat said.

